     ----ssiilleennccee--eerrrroorrss
             Do not print any error, warning, or debugging messages at all.
             Overrides all of ----ddeebbuugg, ----eerrrroorrss--ttoo--ssttddoouutt, and ----pprriinntt--eerrrroorrss.
             This option is overridden and disabled if the
             PKG_CONFIG_DEBUG_SPEW environment variable is set.

     ----ssiimmuullaattee
             Simulates resolving a dependency graph based on the requested
             modules on the command line.  Dumps a series of trees denoting
             pkgconf's resolver state.  This option is only available if the
             preprocessor macro PKGCONF_LITE was not defined during compila‐
